recommend keep-going Every arithmetic piece the Ed25519 verify equation needs now stands GREEN — decode, the scalar ladder, the group law, SHA-512, and scalar reduction mod L. The next crux is the verify assembly itself: [S]B = R + [k]A over the RFC 8032 published test vectors, parity against Zig's Ed25519.verify and the RFC KATs — non-gated public arithmetic. Signing with the maintainer's own identity key stays the custody gate.
